guamp: NMB_PARTIAL_IN=0 turns the 0051 partial copy in off (bridge patch 0057)

fin55 (live-20261106-092610 from line ~7185, mirror captures sel0/sel2): black trails stay behind a card moved in the app
switcher, and the card's preview is black. Bridge patch 0051 copies a loaded attachment into its shadow only inside its draws'
scissors and has no switch, so it cannot be told apart from the scanout's differential copy (guamp-copy-diff), the row flush
(guamp-scanout-rowflush) or the scheduler-thread submit (NMB_SUBMIT_INLINE) without a new build. NMB_PARTIAL_IN=0 (boot line
through guamp-m2v-env, 0019) copies the whole image in again, as before 0051; default unchanged (partial on).
Applies after bridge 0051 (shadow.rs ShadowSync::before). Host: metal2vulkan-runtime --lib shadow, 18 passed.

diff --git a/bridge/patches/0057-guamp-partial-in-switch.patch b/bridge/patches/0057-guamp-partial-in-switch.patch
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/bridge/patches/0057-guamp-partial-in-switch.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@
+diff --git a/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/shadow.rs b/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/shadow.rs
+index a73e17b..45d992c 100644
+--- a/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/shadow.rs
++++ b/crates/metal2vulkan-runtime/src/shadow.rs
+@@ -1041,6 +1041,15 @@ pub(super) struct ShadowUse {
+     pub(super) loads: Option<[u32; 4]>,
+ }
+ 
++/// guamp (partial updates): whether a loaded attachment's copy in may be bounded by
++/// [`ShadowUse::loads`]. `NMB_PARTIAL_IN=0` (boot line through guamp-m2v-env) copies the whole
++/// image in again, as before 0051, to tell the partial copy in apart from other causes of
++/// texels left unredrawn (fin55: black trails behind a card moved in the app switcher).
++fn partial_in() -> bool {
++    static ON: std::sync::OnceLock<bool> = std::sync::OnceLock::new();
++    *ON.get_or_init(|| !std::env::var("NMB_PARTIAL_IN").is_ok_and(|v| v.trim() == "0"))
++}
++
+ /// The rectangle bounding `a` and `b`, each `[x0, y0, x1, y1)`; `None` (anywhere) where either is.
+ fn bounding(a: Option<[u32; 4]>, b: Option<[u32; 4]>) -> Option<[u32; 4]> {
+     let ([a0, a1, a2, a3], [b0, b1, b2, b3]) = (a?, b?);
+@@ -1185,7 +1194,7 @@ impl<M: Clone> ShadowSync<M> {
+                         copies: Arc::clone(&shadow.copies),
+                         step: Step::Into,
+                         kept: shadow.kept,
+-                        area: shadow.loads.filter(|_| !merged && !shadow.kept),
++                        area: shadow.loads.filter(|_| !merged && !shadow.kept && partial_in()),
+                     });
+                 }
+                 self.entries[i].current = true;
